# Session handoff

## At session end

Write HANDOFF.md:
- What I was doing
- Where I left off
- What's done (with file paths)
- What's NOT done (with next step)
- Key context not obvious from the diff
- Open questions
- Verify commands

## At session start

1. Read HANDOFF.md (don't skip)
2. Verify "done" is still done
3. Read context section twice
4. Plan from "not done"
5. Update HANDOFF.md as you work

## When

- Sessions > 30 min
- Before machine switch
- Before context-clear
- Before sleep on multi-day work

## Skip

- Sessions < 30 min with no incomplete work
- One-shot tasks that ship
